    ('wardrobes', 'walk-in-wardrobe', 'Walk-In Wardrobe Fit-Out', 'A dressing room organised to your wardrobe.', 'A complete dressing-room fit-out with open hanging, shelving and drawers — designed around your clothing, shoes and accessories.', '["Room-scale planning","Open and closed storage","Drawers and shoe shelving","Coordinated finishes"]'::jsonb, '[{"src":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687939-ce8a6c25118c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=80","alt":"Calm interior with tailored furniture and natural light"},{"src":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522771739844-6a9f6d5f14af?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=80","alt":"Bed frame dressed with linen bedding"}]'::jsonb, 2),
